<title>SPAIN: Spain's ICO issues 50 bln ptas in 10-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Spain's ICO issues 50 bln ptas in 10-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's state-owned Instituto de Credito Oficial (ICO) said on Friday it will issue 50 billion pesetas in 10-year notes with a coupon of 6.18 percent.</p>
</text>
